  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustained HIV Epidemic Control and Improved Health Outcomes through Strengthened Primary Health Care and Social Service Platforms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Comprehensive Community Prevention and Continuum of Care Program is to support sustained HIV epidemic control and improved health outcomes through strengthened primary health care and social service platforms in Botswana. The activity will support the USAID Vision for Health System Strengthening 2030s three overarching health system goals of equity, quality, and resource optimization through a focus on the health system functions of health financing, leadership, management, and governance; and health workforce.</narrative>
  </description>
